<statement>
<p>
Below are augmented matrices (in reduced row echelon form) corresponding to systems of linear equations. If possible, determine if each system is consistent or inconsistent.</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{0}\amp{9}\amp-{7}\\{0}\amp{1}\amp{2}\amp-{5}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{0}\amp{0}\end{array}\right]}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>consistent</li> 
<li>inconsistent</li> 
<li>impossible to determine</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{0}\amp{0}\amp{0}\\{0}\amp{1}\amp{0}\amp{0}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{1}\amp{0}\end{array}\right]}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>consistent</li> 
<li>inconsistent</li> 
<li>impossible to determine</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{0}\amp{9}\amp{2}\\{0}\amp{1}\amp{7}\amp-{7}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{0}\amp-{5}\end{array}\right]}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>consistent</li> 
<li>inconsistent</li> 
<li>impossible to determine</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{0}\amp{0}\amp{9}\\{0}\amp{1}\amp{0}\amp{7}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{1}\amp-{7}\end{array}\right]}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>consistent</li> 
<li>inconsistent</li> 
<li>impossible to determine</li> 
</ol></p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>A: consistent</li><li>A: consistent</li><li>B: inconsistent</li><li>A: consistent</li></ul></p>
</answer>

</myopenmath>